#N canvas 40 60 1280 1110 12;
#X declare -path ..;
#X obj 0 0 cnv 1 1280 46 empty empty 16\ \ \ Capstone\ \ -\ \ the\ neural\ feedback\ synth\ (NeuralNetwork-VAE-Dense\,\ rebuilt) 14 23 0 20 #1d3557 #ffffff 0;
#X obj 1110 1080 declare -path ..;
#X text 800 1080 finds the nn.* objects one folder up ->, f 42;
#X text 20 1080 neuralplay - Moisés Horta Valenzuela / SEMILLA.AI Studio, f 70;
#X text 20 56 Everything together: a deep network with the shape of an autoencoder (5-4-3-2-1-2-4-5) \, fed by slow LFOs and noise \, its outputs driving oscillators \, ring modulators and resonant pings - and its own output fed back into its input. Rebuilt from the original NeuralNetwork-VAE-Dense patch with the [nn.neuron~] library., f 175;
#X obj 10 96 cnv 1 830 1000 empty empty THE\ NETWORK\ \ (net\ name:\ l16\ -\ one\ message\ reaches\ all\ 27\ neurons) 8 12 0 13 #e3f0fb #1d3557 0;
