#N canvas 40 60 1250 720 voices 0;
#X text 20 10 THE VOICES of the original patch. A: every output drives the frequency of a [phasor~] (output x 59 \, 750 \, 500 \, 250 \, 100 Hz - negative values simply run backwards). B: the phasors multiplied in a chain - ring modulation. C: whenever an output crosses 0.01 upwards ([threshold~]) a 10 ms decaying pulse rings a [bob~] ladder filter at resonance 3.9 \, just below self-oscillation. These pings were disconnected in the last version of the original patch - here they are back., f 170;
#X obj 20 560 *~;
